## Receipt text per state (as visible in the screenshots)

- success:  `Round 1: received 1 answer at ...; saved 1 of 1 at ...`
- partial:  `Round 3: received 2 answers at ...; saved 0 of 2 at ... (2 not saved - firstmate follows up in chat)`
- duplicate:`Round 2: already received at ... (identical to round 1); no new action.`
- completion:`... complete at ...` alongside the ended review's final receipt.

In-page text carries counts and UTC timestamps only - no answer values,
decision keys, prose, paths, or hosts.

