## Reproducing every claimed state

Prerequisites: `lavish-axi`, `tasks-axi`, `jq`, and `chrome-devtools-axi`
installed; a desktop Chrome available to `chrome-devtools-axi`.

1. Scratch home (outside any real Firstmate home):

   ```sh
   E=/tmp/receipt-repro; mkdir -p "$E/home/data" "$E/home/state" "$E/home/config"
   cp .tasks.toml "$E/home/.tasks.toml"
   printf '## In flight\n\n## Queued\n\n## Done\n' > "$E/home/data/backlog.md"
   ```

2. Three captain-held tasks (from inside `$E/home`):

   ```sh
   (cd "$E/home" && tasks-axi add evidence-alpha "Alpha" --kind ship --repo sample --body p)
   (cd "$E/home" && tasks-axi add evidence-beta  "Beta"  --kind ship --repo sample --body p)
   (cd "$E/home" && tasks-axi add evidence-gamma "Gamma" --kind ship --repo sample --body p)
   # hold each: fm-captain-hold.sh hold evidence-alpha --reason demo  (etc.)
   ```

3. Copy `receipt-demo.html` anywhere stable, then bind BEFORE arming and arm
   (the adapter registers the managed poll; arming resets the receipt
   lifecycle):

   ```sh
   sid=$(bin/fm-procevent-lavish.sh source-id "$E/receipt-demo.html")
   bin/fm-captain-hold.sh bind "$sid"
   bin/fm-procevent-lavish.sh arm "$E/receipt-demo.html"
   ```

4. Open the printed session URL in the browser and set the round's
   `window.LAVISH_AUTO_QUEUE` value by editing the `receipt-demo.html` copy
   (Lavish reloads the artifact on file change, the load hook queues exactly
   that spec), then press **Send to Agent**:

   - success round:  `evidence-alpha=go;evidence-gamma=resume`
   - partial round:  `evidence-beta=ship now;evidence-alpha=hold`
     (alpha's task was closed by the success round, so the intake rejects it
     while saving beta: `saved 1 of 2 (1 not saved ...)`)
   - duplicate round: touch the artifact file so the same spec re-queues, and
     send again - identical content digest, reported as already received
   - completion round: clear the spec, type a message, press **Send & End**

   After each Send, run `FM_HOME=$E/home bin/fm-procevent.sh reconcile`
   until the capture appears under `$E/home/state/procevent-inbox/`, then run
   the handler steps exactly as firstmate would and reconcile once more so
   the next armed poll presents the receipt in the page:

   ```sh
   seq=<n>
   bin/fm-procevent-lavish.sh applying "$sid" "$seq"
   bin/fm-procevent-lavish.sh complete "$sid" "$seq"
   bin/fm-procevent.sh handled "$sid" "$seq"
   bin/fm-procevent.sh reconcile
   ```

5. Screenshots:

   ```sh
   chrome-devtools-axi resize 1280 800                       # laptop
   chrome-devtools-axi emulate --viewport "375x812x2,mobile,touch"   # mobile
   chrome-devtools-axi eval '() => { document.documentElement.style.zoom = "2"; }'  # 200%
   chrome-devtools-axi screenshot <state>-<variant>.png
   ```

The ended review retires only after its final receipt was displayed (or the
session became unreceivable), so the completion round ends with the source
gone from `$E/home/state/procevent/` while the page still shows the final
receipt under the "Session ended." notice.

